    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tscerpi_rate2"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "$tscerpi_rate2 is the employer basic old-age insurance contribution rate applied to whole gross income (the uncapped tranche, on top of the Income-Group-A rate). Its value (2.11%) matches contributions.md's 2026 'Change' figure for the 'Employer Old Age' whole-income rate, up from 2.02% in 2024-2025 and 1.90% in 2022-2023. It is used in tscer_fr/BenCalc as part of the main old-age insurance contribution calculation, alongside $tscerpi_rate1."
    },
